td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Cytokeratin 19</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">KRT19</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>&#x02212;0.69</bold></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>0.001</bold></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label/><p>EGFR=epidermal growth factor receptor.</p></fn><fn id="t2-fn2"><label/><p>Significant correlations are given in bold.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>